& [Requirements]
  + [OBT-001] add one PowerShell initial-create-only operator bootstrap transaction without changing the legacy initializer contract
  + [OBT-002] require exact environment runtime-directory cantord allowed-root and loopback-listener inputs and resolve them to absolute identities
  + [OBT-003] require environment and cantord to be bounded physical regular files and allowed root and runtime parent to be physical directories
  + [OBT-004] require the environment to be contained by the allowed root and refuse drive repository user-profile parent traversal reparse and path-collision hazards
  + [OBT-005] require the final runtime directory to be absent and provide no replace repair merge migration or overwrite option
  + [OBT-006] create one cryptographically random 256-bit hexadecimal bearer capability only inside one validated sibling staging directory
  + [OBT-007] create strict activation sequence one and strict service configuration using the existing schemas bounds and exact final authority paths
  + [OBT-008] create one staging-only candidate configuration and activation whose paths are internally coherent for prepublication validation
  + [OBT-009] invoke exact supplied cantord check-config over the staging candidate and require ready exit zero one compact JSON line and no stderr
  + [OBT-010] remove staging-only validation artifacts before publication and require the staging inventory to contain exactly cantord.token activation.json and service.json
  + [OBT-011] publish the complete staging directory to the absent final runtime path through one same-parent Directory Move
  + [OBT-012] invoke exact cantord check-config over the final service config and require ready exit zero one compact JSON line and no stderr
  + [OBT-013] on any prepublication fault remove only the exact owned nonreparse staging leaf and leave the final path absent
  + [OBT-014] on postpublication diagnostic fault roll back only when the final directory inventory and artifact identities still equal the transaction-owned publication otherwise preserve the residual for operator review
  + [OBT-015] emit one compact cantor-operator-bootstrap-transaction/0.1 initialized receipt and newline only after final diagnostic success
  + [OBT-016] receipt records config activation environment and listen identities publication mode validation booleans and exhaustive secret/effect false claims
  + [OBT-017] receipt and faults never contain token path token bytes token hash raw diagnostic message environment content or signing material
  + [OBT-018] prove success final diagnostic readiness exact three-file inventory receipt redaction and complete test-root cleanup
  + [OBT-019] prove nonloopback uncontained environment preexisting final root file-as-root reparse when supported invalid cantord and postpublish tamper refusals
  + [OBT-020] retain one provider-free sanitized checked receipt with source script cantord Cargo.lock fixture cleanup and capability-denial evidence
  + [OBT-021] provide an independent evidence verifier and adversarial receipt verifier that never create secrets or invoke cantord
  + [OBT-022] update operator and product-readiness documentation while keeping supported delivery production trust secret lifecycle replacement repair migration and acceptance open
  + [OBT-023] pass focused transaction and evidence gates warnings-denied applicable lint format all-script parse recursive evidence attribution publication and post-push replay
  + [OBT-024] never start a service contact a provider download install access remote hosts persist semantic effects use FPGA or enter Minecraft scope

